package app.lekto.ui.icons

/**
 * The app's icon pack: Lucide geometry on a 24-unit grid, a 2-unit stroke, round
 * caps and joins ([docs/design.md](https://github.com/Domingax/lekto/blob/main/docs/design.md), §5).
 *
 * The icons in this package are generated once from the pinned Lucide tag and
 * committed as `ImageVector` Kotlin, so the app carries no icon dependency and
 * nothing is loaded at runtime. Regenerate the whole set with
 * `tools/icons/fetch.sh`; never edit a generated file — the script overwrites
 * it, and the licence notice lives in `THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md`.
 *
 * This object is the pack the generated extension properties hang off
 * (`LektoIcons.BookOpen` and the rest); it is hand-written and the script keeps
 * it.
 */
object LektoIcons
